    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "e273da0d9c994fd19488205fb0a2f791",
    "m_Title": "EDITOR_MODE",
    "m_Content": "Conditional Compilation Flag.\n\nIf FALSE: ColorTexture and HitTexture are sampled directly. Since these textures do not change, it implies voxel modification is not possible. (Fine in editor preview mode, would not work in running game)\n\nIf TRUE: StructuredBuffers (Not exposed as Shader Properties but nevertheless bound) are used instead. These represent dynamic voxel data.",
